{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31570","headline":"玉真观 · 李羣玉","name":"玉真观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高情帝女慕乘鸾，绀发初簪玉叶冠。\n秋月无云生碧落，素蕖寒露出清澜。\n层城烟雾将归远，浮世尘埃久住难。\n一自箫声飞去後，洞宫深掩碧瑶坛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31570.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31570","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}